%% Technical view: what runs where.
flowchart TB
  sched{Scheduler} -->|daily 06:15 UTC| job[Ingest container: complaints-ingest]
  sched -.- k8scron[K8s CronJob]
  sched -.- eb[AWS EventBridge Scheduler]
  sched -.- caj[Azure Container Apps Job]
  sched -.- cs[GCP Cloud Scheduler → Cloud Run job]
  job -->|HTTPS| cfpb[(CFPB API)]
  job -->|DATABASE_URL from secret store| db[(Postgres 16: StatefulSet / RDS / Flexible Server / Cloud SQL)]
  user[User] -->|HTTPS| entry{Entry point}
  entry -->|desktop| pf[127.0.0.1 port / port-forward]
  entry -->|cloud| managed[Fargate public IP / Container Apps / Cloud Run URL]
  entry -->|OpenShift| route[Route, edge TLS]
  pf --> api[API pod: non-root, read-only FS]
  managed --> api
  route --> api
  api --> db
  api -->|/metrics/| prom[Prometheus] --> graf[Grafana]
